  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Diamond Classes: Renowned Warrior and the Peach Tree Oath</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Str 19, Power Attack, Two-Handed Fighting, Improved Two-Handed Fighting, base attack bonus +11.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using the Two-Handed Fighting feat, increase your Strength bonus on damage rolls by an additional 1/2-times your Strength bonus on your first attack made each round (normally 3-times your Strength bonus).</p>\n<p>In addition, whenever you make a sweeping strike, you may choose up to 3 spaces. When dealing damage with a sweeping strike, you now also add bonus damage from class features, feats, spells, and other effects to the damage dealt (but not bonus damage dice, such as from a weapon with the flaming special weapon ability).</p>\n<p><strong>Example:</strong> Chandou the Greatspear has the weapon training class feature and the favored enemy class feature. When making a sweeping strike, Chandou would add his weapon training bonus to the damage dealt with a sweeping strike and would add his favored enemy bonus as bonus damage against creatures which his favored enemy class feature would apply against.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/combat-feats#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
